        <!-- Big Agency Headline -->
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
          Jajanan Lezat, <br class="hidden sm:inline"/>
          <span class="text-brand-orange">Dilacak Cepat</span> <br class="hidden sm:inline"/>
          Di Sekitarmu
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtitle -->
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0">
          Lapar dan rindu jajanan kaki lima favorit? NemuSnack memetakan lokasi gerobak mangkal maupun rute keliling secara live, hangat, dan siap dinikmati kapan saja.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-1">
          <a href="/menu" 
             class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-black text-base text-white bg-brand-orange hover:bg-brand-orange-hover shadow-xl shadow-brand-orange/30 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-brand-orange/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-200">
            <span>Cari Jajanan Sekarang</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a href="#map-tracking" 
             class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-base text-gray-800 bg-white hover:bg-orange-50 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow transition-all duration-200 group">
